---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Our Mission" description="To accompany, empower and restore hope — the IICC Mission serves those most in need.">

  <!-- Dark hero -->
  <div class="hero-full" style="min-height:55vh;">
    <div class="hero-full__bg">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469571486292-0ba58a3f068b?w=1400&h=700&fit=crop"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="hero-full__overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-full__content" style="padding-top:6rem;padding-bottom:6rem;">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--white" style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;display:block;">IICC Mission</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.5rem);font-weight:900;color:#fff;letter-spacing:0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
        OUR MISSION
      </h1>
      <span class="rule rule--amber" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;display:block;"></span>
      <p style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:clamp(1.25rem,3vw,2rem);color:#fff;line-height:1.4;max-width:540px;">
        To accompany, empower<br>and restore <span style="color:var(--color-amber);">hope.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Mission statement -->
  <section class="section section--navy">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--white">What We Do</span>
        <span class="heart">♥</span>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem);letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;">OUR MISSION AREAS</h2>
        <span class="rule rule--amber rule--center"></span>
        <p class="section-desc section-desc--white" style="text-align:center;margin-top:0.5rem;max-width:560px;">
          To share Christ's love and stand in solidarity with people in need. We provide pastoral care, advocacy, and essential support while upholding the dignity and rights of every person.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card--dark" style="align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:2rem;">
          <div class="card__icon" style="border-color:rgba(224,123,0,0.5);">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M18 8h1a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-1"/><path d="M2 8h16v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H6a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8z"/><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="4"/><line x1="10" y1="1" x2="10" y2="4"/><line x1="14" y1="1" x2="14" y2="4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="card__title">Spiritual &amp; Pastoral Care</p>
          <p class="card__body">Supporting people through faith, prayer and guidance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card--dark" style="align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:2rem;">
          <div class="card__icon" style="border-color:rgba(224,123,0,0.5);">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="card__title">Justice &amp; Advocacy</p>
          <p class="card__body">Promoting dignity, fairness and support.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card--dark" style="align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:2rem;">
          <div class="card__icon" style="border-color:rgba(224,123,0,0.5);">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="9"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="5"/><rect x="14" y="12" width="7" height="9"/><rect x="3" y="16" width="7" height="5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="card__title">Prisoner &amp; Former Prisoner Support</p>
          <p class="card__body">Helping people rebuild and reintegrate into the community.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card--dark" style="align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:2rem;">
          <div class="card__icon" style="border-color:rgba(224,123,0,0.5);">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="card__title">Immigration Detainee Support</p>
          <p class="card__body" style="color:var(--color-amber);">Standing alongside people during uncertain times.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card--dark" style="align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:2rem;">
          <div class="card__icon" style="border-color:rgba(224,123,0,0.5);">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="card__title">Family Support</p>
          <p class="card__body">Strengthening families affected by hardship and challenges.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card--dark" style="align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:2rem;">
          <div class="card__icon" style="border-color:rgba(224,123,0,0.5);">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="card__title">Healing &amp; Reintegration</p>
          <p class="card__body">Creating pathways toward healing, restoration and hope.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We Do It -->
  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cols-2" style="gap:4rem;">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;display:block;">Our Approach</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Accompaniment Over Abandonment</h2>
          <span class="rule rule--amber" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;display:block;"></span>
          <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            We believe every person deserves to be met where they are. Our mission is rooted in the Catholic tradition of accompaniment — walking alongside those who are suffering, listening without judgment, and offering practical help alongside spiritual care.
          </p>
          <p class="section-desc" style="max-width:none;margin-bottom:2rem;">
            We partner with individuals, families, parishes, and community organisations to bring hope where it is most needed.
          </p>
          <a href="/our-services" class="btn btn--amber">EXPLORE OUR PROGRAMS →</a>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;">
          <div class="quote-box">
            <span class="quote-box__mark">"</span>
            <p class="quote-box__text">
              For I was hungry and you gave me food, I was thirsty and you gave me drink, I was a stranger and you welcomed me.
            </p>
            <span class="quote-box__ref">— Matthew 25:35</span>
          </div>
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529156069898-49953e39b3ac?w=600&h=300&fit=crop"
            alt="People helping each other"
            style="width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA band -->
  <div class="amber-band">
    <div class="wrap" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1.5rem;">
      <div>
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff;letter-spacing:0.04em;">
          ♥ JOIN OUR MISSION
        </p>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);font-size:0.9375rem;margin-top:0.25rem;">
          Together we can accompany, empower and restore hope.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/get-involved" class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:var(--color-amber);font-weight:800;">
        GET INVOLVED →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
